{"version":1,"youtubeId":"rb2EkzjgO98","start":116,"end":149,"segments":[{"start":116,"end":149,"mode":"F","confidence":0,"focus":{"x":0.5,"y":0.45}}],"sentences":[{"text":"Um, there's a hadith that is quite beautiful.","s":116.2,"e":119.28,"next":119.28,"key":"beautiful","words":[{"w":"Um,","t":116.2},{"w":"there's","t":116.72},{"w":"a","t":117},{"w":"hadith","t":117.15},{"w":"that","t":117.6},{"w":"is","t":117.84},{"w":"quite","t":118.04},{"w":"beautiful.","t":118.36}]},{"text":"In which the Rasul, alayhi salatu wa salam,","s":119.28,"e":121.36,"next":121.36,"key":"alayhi","words":[{"w":"In","t":119.28},{"w":"which","t":119.52},{"w":"the","t":119.72},{"w":"Rasul,","t":119.87},{"w":"alayhi","t":120.52},{"w":"salatu","t":120.67},{"w":"wa","t":120.84},{"w":"salam,","t":120.99}]},{"text":"he said that the believer's affair is quite unique.","s":121.36,"e":126,"next":126.08,"key":"believer's","words":[{"w":"he","t":121.36},{"w":"said","t":121.52},{"w":"that","t":121.84},{"w":"the","t":122.64},{"w":"believer's","t":122.84},{"w":"affair","t":123.4},{"w":"is","t":123.88},{"w":"quite","t":124.08},{"w":"unique.","t":124.6}]},{"text":"If hardship comes, the believer is patient, and that is good.","s":126.08,"e":131.6,"next":131.6,"key":"hardship","words":[{"w":"If","t":126.08},{"w":"hardship","t":126.4},{"w":"comes,","t":127},{"w":"the","t":128.12},{"w":"believer","t":128.32},{"w":"is","t":129},{"w":"patient,","t":129.36},{"w":"and","t":129.96},{"w":"that","t":130.12},{"w":"is","t":130.32},{"w":"good.","t":130.52}]},{"text":"And if ease comes, the believer is grateful, and that is also good.","s":131.6,"e":136.32,"next":136.32,"key":"believer","words":[{"w":"And","t":131.6},{"w":"if","t":131.84},{"w":"ease","t":132.24},{"w":"comes,","t":132.68},{"w":"the","t":133.04},{"w":"believer","t":133.19},{"w":"is","t":133.64},{"w":"grateful,","t":133.96},{"w":"and","t":134.68},{"w":"that","t":134.84},{"w":"is","t":135},{"w":"also","t":135.15},{"w":"good.","t":135.52}]},{"text":"What t